ll. WordPress portfolio images are already in `public/images/wp/`. For any client missing a screenshot, use a placeholder pattern (gradient card with the site URL). Done = every client has an image source identified.\n3. **Build client data array** \u2014 Inline in the page component (no database, no MDX \u2014 just a typed array). Each entry: `{ name, url, image, description }`. The 12 clients: Daxcopilot.ai, Carrier-Advisors.com, Duke-Multimedia.com, Advan-Bio.com, Trustandobey.live, Idyll-Awhile.com, Sagexteriorcleaning.com, ThrivingNumbers.com, ScraperSky.com, Idaho Telecom Experts, HarmonyTech.io, Improvemyrankings.com. Done = typed array with all 12 entries.\n4. **Style to match the site** \u2014 Dark theme (`#141010` bg, `#f5f0e8` text, `#a63d3d` primary, `#3d9999` accent). Cards use `glass` utility class. Framer Motion entrance animations. Responsive: 1 col mobile, 2 col tablet, 3 col desktop. Done = visually consistent with existing sections.\n5. **Verify the ClientsPortfolio.tsx teaser card** \u2014 Confirm the \"View Portfolio\" link at `/portfolio` works end-to-end. Done = clicking the teaser card on homepage navigates to the gallery page.\n6. **Build passes** \u2014 `npm run build` exits zero. Done = no type errors, no missing imports.\n\n### Verification\n```bash\nnpm run build                           # Zero errors\nls src/app/portfolio/page.tsx           # File exists\ngrep -c \"Daxcopilot\" src/app/portfolio/page.tsx  # At least 1 match (confirms real clients)\ngrep -c \"TechFlow\\|Green Earth\\|Nexus\\|Bright Academy\" src/app/portfolio/page.tsx  # Zero matches (no fabricated)\n```\n\n### Constraints\n- **No invented metrics.** No \"300% increase\" claims. Gallery shows the site, the URL, and what we did. That's it.\n- **No named client metrics without consent.** Descriptions are factual: \"WordPress maintenance and hosting\" not \"increased traffic 40%.\"\n- **`npm run build` must pass before push.** Red light rule.\n- **Use hex colors, not HSL.*